  "label": "The text 'we are fighting this together' maps the woman onto the collective response to the 9/11 attacks.",
  "description": "The phrase 'we are fighting this together' in the text overlay is used to imply that the woman is part of the collective response to the 9/11 attacks. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman is projected as being part of the 'we' that is fighting, which is visually represented by the image of the 9/11 attacks. The mapping is established through the juxtaposition of the text and the visual, where the woman is implicitly equated with the collective response to the event.",
